    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925730/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1714163804\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Combat Cat is a fast-paced, side-scrolling, bullet hell where you fight against an endless horde of angry slimes <br>as a combat ready cat! <br><br>Shoot, dash and fly your way around the areas as slimes try to stop your journey!<br><br>After each level the slimes grow in power, but so do you! Upgrade your weapon and cat with the thirty unique items <br>the slimes drop along the way! Use these items for infinite customizability options! Homing shotgun? Super powered <br>sniper? The choice is yours! <br><br>Face off against four diverse slime types and three different challenging bosses as your journey progresses! <br>If you're ready for a real fight try a higher difficulty or maybe even the truly chaotic slime rain mode! <br>Or have fun and experiment in the creative mode to build the combat cat of your dreams!<br> <br>Go on now! Create your Combat Cat and survive as long as you can!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925730/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1714163804\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Jump, Dash, and fly around the arena!<br></li><li>Upgrade your weapon and cat for infinite combat options!  <br></li><li>Different game modes including creative mode for experimenting and slime rain for maximum chaos!<br></li><li>Ending Stats screen to see how far you have come!<br></li><li>Four slime types and three different bosses!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925730/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1714163804\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
